:\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sHSDW8Vc3BdbQ7evnFcUxhtHsr0.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1004663,\"title\":\"All the Beauty and the Bloodshed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cvO51xxtIUHc5w5ZgFsigiFaUaO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anw7ONmtm1BrHd1Du0GQ5FoNd6r.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of internationally renowned artist and activist Nan Goldin is told through her slideshows, intimate interviews, ground-breaking photography, and rare footage of her personal fight to hold the Sackler family accountable for the overdose crisis.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1666428,\"title\":\"MIGAJERO!!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fot4D3fAYA21CafbCIvwGuIVZKX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7o70XRYBPOhrzl0hI3kd3Ioxgft.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is an intimate and fragmented portrait of what it means to fall in love in the 21st century. Where desire, breadcrumbing, and vulnerability intertwine in a process of falling, self-creation, and pure frenzy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":665913,\"title\":\"Legendary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ueowwmclDnprqOuSFwYg3IAYvLh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An inside look into the effort to preserve Philadelphia's ballroom scene, a black LGBTQ safe-space that has endured for 30 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":664372,\"title\":\"Les vendredis d'Apostrophes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ewMifK17s1147QoVGF7Xna2rcmA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aItcbIKzpoMhMrAWlmU9qqzQvdx.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hours and historical meetings, Pierre Assouline has composed an anthology of the best extracts presented in the form of a primer, which he had commented on by a surprised Bernard Pivot.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":288301,\"title\":\"Do I Sound Gay?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJuiiHt0d5sicgDBtXwr6kdKErZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rRNp6KMqiN4ThbQj3WrE8uzsMf2.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What makes a voice “gay”? A breakup with his boyfriend sets journalist David Thorpe on a quest to unravel a linguistic mystery.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":288763,\"title\":\"Escape to Life: The Erika and Klaus Mann Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g4jCqhcNgH8LuFlOX0RKNCEXFru.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary contains dramatized episodes about the lives of Erika and Klaus Mann, the brilliant children of German writer Thomas Mann.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1473848,\"title\":\"Quest for Beauty: The Life and Art of William Schickel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wnCRNOv0KCk1Wt68KY5wzNziaF7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Quest for Beauty is a film documentary on the life and prolific art career of William Schickel who was a prominent 20th century Catholic artist. Schickel had a very prolific art career spanning sixty-plus years; he produced a large body of mostly commissioned work in painting, sculpture, stained glass, and architectural design. He is most well-known for his renovation of the Abbey of Gethsemani in Kentucky, where he worked personally with Thomas Merton. His works can be found in numerous private collections and museums, including the Vatican Museum. The film explores his Quest for Beauty and the challenges he faced, and his vision for the Church and his heart for unity in the Body of Christ.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1254830,\"title\":\"Not Withholding Anything from You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c7BPQQaBDPJATKC44asN4UahHnz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"How do artists view their own work? How does actor Esko Salminen immerse himself in his roles, how does the writer/director Saara Turunen create a whole new world for the stage, and why does musician PK Keränen pick up his guitar time and time again? Is creativity a conscious or subconscious process, a pleasure or a compulsion? Veikko Aaltonen’s documentary takes us straight into the heart of creativity with artists from different fields and generations. Celebrating the various forms of passion and creative work, the film presents a compelling case for the significance of art.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1454991,\"title\":\"Bulgaria in Trance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bS2lRzeiWTXTRDwaW8QUzqe8qVG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6F7zmEEZCBjfbM46Z0JYZk3eR1v.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"“Bulgaria in Trance” aims to make an impartial portrait of the trans community in Bulgaria by telling the personal stories of the trans women who took part in the exhibition “The Other Bulgarians”.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":861146,\"title\":\"Always Forward\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ZIKEITbjO7L6RCZZyZss5gWP2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2AVRgCjBlpiFNaNIOR3HYMnYPp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Plastic artist Aparicio Arthola talks with his student about the catarsis in his creative process, the loss, death and uncertainty of art life in Nicaragua\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860979,\"title\":\"Jul för nybörjare\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bD1gpzo00QkTCXlDkcoqNwAyGop.jpg\